== Acceptance criteria ==

Wave 13 is ready to leave Phase 3 when:

# all 51 reader surfaces remain present;
# one concept = one Core semantic identity;
# Internet/Web and authentication/authorization boundaries remain explicit;
# no deferred concept is represented as an existing canonical link;
# controlled Domains pass;
# derivatives remain category/identity-exempt;
# complete V2 release gates and staging pass.

